    "title": "Solitaire: Big Card Games",
    "description": "Solitaire is a Classic Solitaire Game for seniors! Based on the classic card game, it has larger cards and larger fonts, and its simple operation method is more in line with the operating habits of the seniors. This free card game takes you to embark on a journey filled with relaxation, brain-boosting fun, and special moments to reminisce on the good old days.\r\n\r\nIf you like classic Solitaire, you're going to love this beautiful solitaire card game! Here you can try daily challenges and addictive card games. Or play unlimited random card games and winnable card games! These addictive card puzzles will hook you on Classic Solitaire card games! Download Solitaire card games now and start playing our addictive card game!\r\n\r\nNo Wi-Fi? No problem! Enjoy these simple yet compelling solitaire card games and puzzles whenever and wherever life takes you. Try out our free solitaire card games. The intuitive design ensures anyone can pick up and play with ease and have their briefly skills tested while remaining mindful and calm.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 How to play \u2b50\r\nThere is one deck - 52 solitaire cards in the classic Solitaire game. Tap or drag cards to arrange them in descending order with alternating colors.\u00a0For example, a black 10 could only be followed by a red 9. Only a King could be placed in the Free Column. You can move the stack of solitaire cards by dragging the whole stack to another column. You can choose between drawing one card at a time for a more relaxing game, or three cards for a challenging brain workout!\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Highlights \u2b50\r\n- A simpler and more intuitive version of the classic card game.\r\n- Personalize your experience: Customize the card backs and backgrounds you like.\r\n- Daily Challenges: Earn crowns and trophies by solving new challenges every day.\r\n- Thousands of classic solitaire challenges for you to play anytime, anywhere!\r\n- Standard Solitaire \r\nscoring system.\r\n- Unlimited hints and undo. Playing solitaire could be easier.\r\n- Smart hints show potentially useful moves.\r\n- Free choice between left-handed option and right-handed option.\r\n- Play games offline anytime and anywhere.\r\n\r\nNow comes this popular card game for players of any age! If you like solitaire card game, come and join us!\r\n\r\nWe are constantly improving to make this free card game better and better. Try this solitaire game, you will find it's really fun and relaxing! Enjoy yourself with the popular and classic solitaire card games for free!",
